<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="ja-JP"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="668479"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1537403800"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="again"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="YUI"/><amll:meta key="album" value="again"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="04:14.000"><div begin="00:20.449" end="03:48.410"><p begin="00:20.449" end="00:22.505" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2161">夢のつづき<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">梦想的延续</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">yu me no tsu zu ki</span></p><p begin="00:22.535" end="00:26.386" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2162">追いかけていたはずなのに<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">曾经我一直在追逐</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">o i ka ke te i ta ha zu na no ni</span></p><p begin="00:27.177" end="00:30.328" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2163">曲がりくねった 細い道<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">可狭窄的道路竟如此坎坷</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ma ga ri ku ne 't ta ho so i mi chi</span></p><p begin="00:30.338" end="00:33.086" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2164">人につまずく<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让我挫折于人生旅途</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">hi to ni tsu ma zu ku</span></p><p begin="00:33.351" end="00:34.776" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2165">あの頃みたいにって<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">口中说着怀念的感言</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a no ko ro mi ta i ni 't te</span></p><p begin="00:34.786" end="00:36.531" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2166">戻りたい訳じゃないの<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">并非是渴望回到从前</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mo do ri ta i wa ke ja na i no</span></p><p begin="00:36.541" end="00:38.669" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2167">無くしてきた空を<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只不过是在寻觅一路失去的天空</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">na ku shi te ki ta so ra wo</span></p><p begin="00:38.679" end="00:40.132" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2168">探してる<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">探してる</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">sa ga shi te ru</span></p><p begin="00:40.162" end="00:41.608" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2169">わかってくれますように<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">希望大家能够理解我</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">wa ka 't te ku re ma su yo u ni</span></p><p begin="00:41.618" end="00:43.304" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2170">犠牲になったような<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">拜托别再流露出一副</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">gi se i ni na 't ta yo u na</span></p><p begin="00:43.314" end="00:46.905" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2171">悲しい顔はやめてよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">仿佛成为了牺牲品似的悲哀表情</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ka na shi i ka o wa ya me te yo</span></p><p begin="00:46.915" end="00:48.570" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2172">罪の最後は涙じゃないよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">过错并不会靠流泪就结束</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">tsu mi no sa i go wa na mi da ja na i yo</span></p><p begin="00:48.600" end="00:50.355" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2173">ずっと苦しく背負ってくんだ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">它将永远成为心头的负担</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">zu 't to ku ru shi ku se o 't te ku n da</span></p><p begin="00:50.365" end="00:51.918" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2174">出口見えない感情迷路に<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">徘徊在这看不见出口的感情迷途</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">de gu chi mi e na i ka n jo u me i ro ni</span></p><p begin="00:51.928" end="00:53.690" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2175">誰を待ってるの？<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我到底是在等待着谁</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">da re wo ma 't te ru no ?</span></p><p begin="00:53.700" end="00:55.382" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2176">白いノートに綴ったように<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">像自己曾经在白纸上写过的那样</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">shi ro i no o to ni tsu zu 't ta yo u ni</span></p><p begin="00:55.412" end="00:57.208" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2177">もっと素直に吐き出したいよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我好想更加直率地发泄心中的情感</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mo 't to su na o ni ha ki da shi ta i yo</span></p><p begin="00:57.218" end="00:57.966" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2178">何から<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">好想逃脱身边的</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">na ni ka ra</span></p><p begin="00:57.976" end="00:58.761" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2179">逃れたいんだ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">种种桎梏</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">no ga re ta i n da</span></p><p begin="00:58.771" end="01:00.207" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2180">…現実ってやつ？<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那就是所谓的现实吗</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ge n ji tsu 't te ya tsu ?</span></p><p begin="01:00.217" end="01:02.003" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2181">叶えるために<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">本是为了实现梦想</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ka na e ru ta me ni</span></p><p begin="01:02.013" end="01:03.722" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2182">生きてるんだって<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">才活在这一生</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i ki te ru n da 't te</span></p><p begin="01:03.732" end="01:05.374" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2183">忘れちゃいそうな<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">可黑夜当头</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">wa su re cha i so u na</span></p><p begin="01:05.384" end="01:07.130" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2184">夜の真ん中<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让我几乎忘却了初衷</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">yo ru no ma n na ka</span></p><p begin="01:07.140" end="01:08.854" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2185">無難になんて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">什么低调隐忍</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">bu na n ni na n te</span></p><p begin="01:08.864" end="01:12.266" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2186">やってられないから<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我已经忍无可忍</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ya 't te ra re na i ka ra</span></p><p begin="01:12.276" end="01:13.961" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2187">…帰る場所もないの<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">反正我也没有回头路</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ka e ru ba sho mo na i no</span></p><p begin="01:13.971" end="01:17.364" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2188">この想いを 消してしまうには<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">何必要打消心头这份思念</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko no o mo i wo ke shi te shi ma u ni wa</span></p><p begin="01:17.374" end="01:19.348" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2189">まだ人生長いでしょ？<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">人生来日方长不是么</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ma da ji n se i na ga i de sho ?</span></p><p begin="01:20.836" end="01:22.745" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2190">懐かしくなる<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">反正也算一种怀旧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">na tsu ka shi ku na ru</span></p><p begin="01:22.755" end="01:24.548" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2191">こんな痛みも歓迎じゃん<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这些痛楚 我就算欢迎又何妨</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko n na i ta mi mo ka n ge i ja n</span></p><p begin="01:32.421" end="01:36.289" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2193">謝らなくちゃいけないよね<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">看来我必须道歉才行了</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a ya ma ra na ku cha i ke na i yo ne</span></p><p begin="01:36.299" end="01:38.209" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2194">Ah ごめんね<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">好吧抱歉</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ah go me n ne</span></p><p begin="01:39.253" end="01:41.330" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2195">うまく言えなくて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">都怪我不擅长言语表达</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">u ma ku i e na ku te</span></p><p begin="01:41.360" end="01:45.041" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2196">心配かけたままだったね<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这段时间让大家担心了</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">shi n pa i ka ke ta ma ma da 't ta ne</span></p><p begin="01:45.285" end="01:46.753" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2197">あの日 かかえた全部<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那天我曾负担的全部</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a no hi ka ka e ta ze n bu</span></p><p begin="01:46.763" end="01:48.465" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2198">あした かかえる全部<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">明天我将负担的全部</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a shi ta ka ka e ru ze n bu</span></p><p begin="01:48.475" end="01:50.625" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2199">順番つけたりは<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我从不会把它们</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ju n ba n tsu ke ta ri wa</span></p><p begin="01:50.635" end="01:52.093" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2200">しないから<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">编上先后的序号</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">shi na i ka ra</span></p><p begin="01:52.123" end="01:53.627" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2201">わかってくれますように<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">希望大家能够理解我</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">wa ka 't te ku re ma su yo u ni</span></p><p begin="01:53.637" end="01:55.302" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2202">そっと目を閉じたんだ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我只是悄悄闭上了眼</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">so 't to me wo to ji ta n da</span></p><p begin="01:55.312" end="01:57.462" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2203">見たくないものまで<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">毕竟那样就</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mi ta ku na i mo no ma de</span></p><p begin="01:57.472" end="01:58.955" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2204">見えんだもん<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">看不见不想见的东西</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mi e n da mo n</span></p><p begin="01:58.965" end="02:00.669" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2205">いらないウワサにちょっと<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那些无谓的传言拜托打住</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i ra na i u wa sa ni cho 't to</span></p><p begin="02:00.699" end="02:02.254" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2206">初めて聞く発言どっち？<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那些从未听过的说法到底？</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ha ji me te ki ku ha tsu ge n do 'c chi ?</span></p><p begin="02:02.284" end="02:03.878" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2207">2回会ったら友達だって？<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">才见了两次面就自诩是朋友？</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ni ka i a 't ta ra to mo da chi da 't te ??</span></p><p begin="02:03.888" end="02:05.809" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2208">ウソはやめてね<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">拜托不要再欺骗我了</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">u so wa ya me te ne</span></p><p begin="02:05.819" end="02:07.505" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2209">赤いハートが苛立つように<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">鲜红的心脏仿佛焦虑不安</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a ka i ha a to ga i ra da tsu yo u ni</span></p><p begin="02:07.515" end="02:09.201" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2210">身体ん中燃えているんだ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">身体的每处仿佛都在燃烧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ka ra da n na ka mo e te i ru n da</span></p><p begin="02:09.211" end="02:09.905" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2211">ホントは<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">原来我其实</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ho n to wa</span></p><p begin="02:09.915" end="02:10.739" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2212">期待してんの<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">真充满了期待</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki ta i shi te n no</span></p><p begin="02:10.749" end="02:12.222" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2213">…現実ってやつ？<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">期待着所谓的现实？</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ge n ji tsu 't te ya tsu ?</span></p><p begin="02:12.232" end="02:13.977" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2214">叶えるために<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我是为了实现梦想</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ka na e ru ta me ni</span></p><p begin="02:13.987" end="02:15.571" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2215">生きてるんだって<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">才活在这一生</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i ki te ru n da 't te</span></p><p begin="02:15.581" end="02:17.363" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2216">叫びたくなるよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">好想大声喊出来</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">sa ke bi ta ku na ru yo</span></p><p begin="02:17.373" end="02:19.027" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2217">聞こえていますか？<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你们是否听见？</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki ko e te i ma su ka ?</span></p><p begin="02:19.037" end="02:20.757" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2218">無難になんて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">什么低调隐忍</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">bu na n ni na n te</span></p><p begin="02:20.767" end="02:24.196" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2219">やってられないから<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我已经忍无可忍</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ya 't te ra re na i ka ra</span></p><p begin="02:24.226" end="02:25.886" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2220">…帰る場所もないの<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">反正我也没有回头路</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ka e ru ba sho mo na i no</span></p><p begin="02:25.896" end="02:29.283" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2221">優しさには いつも感謝してる<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">对大家的善意 我时刻满怀感激</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ya sa shi sa ni wa i tsu mo ka n sha shi te ru</span></p><p begin="02:29.293" end="02:31.342" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2222">だから強くなりたい<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">所以我才向往着更强</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">da ka ra tsu yo ku na ri ta i</span></p><p begin="02:32.771" end="02:34.713" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2223">進むために<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只要能够让我前进</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">su su mu ta me ni</span></p><p begin="02:34.723" end="02:36.473" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2224">敵も味方も歓迎じゃん<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">是敌是友 我全都欢迎又何妨</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">te ki mo mi ka ta mo ka n ge i ja n</span></p><p begin="02:36.483" end="02:39.630" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2225">どうやって次のドア<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">该怎么打开下一扇门来着</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">do u ya 't te tsu gi no do a</span></p><p begin="02:39.640" end="02:42.931" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2226">開けるんだっけ？考えてる？<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如今我正在考虑</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a ke ru n da 'k ke ? ka n ga e te ru ?</span></p><p begin="02:43.277" end="02:46.462" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2227">もう引き返せない<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">总之再也不能回头</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mo u hi ki ka e se na i</span></p><p begin="02:46.472" end="02:49.790" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2228">物語 始まってるんだ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我的人生故事早已经开始</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mo no ga ta ri ha ji ma 't te ru n da</span></p><p begin="02:50.120" end="02:57.122" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2229">目を覚ませ 目を覚ませ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">劝自己醒醒吧 快醒醒吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">me wo sa ma se me wo sa ma se</span></p><p begin="03:10.510" end="03:13.892" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2231">この想いを 消してしまうには<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">何必要打消心头这份思念</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko no o mo i wo ke shi te shi ma u ni wa</span></p><p begin="03:13.902" end="03:15.859" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2232">まだ人生長いでしょ？<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">人生来日方长不是么</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ma da ji n se i na ga i de sho ?</span></p><p begin="03:17.354" end="03:19.071" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2233">やり残してるコト<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那些尚未完成的目标</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ya ri no ko shi te ru ko to</span></p><p begin="03:19.081" end="03:22.704" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2234">やり直してみたいから<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">今后我想要全都重新来过</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ya ri na o shi te mi ta i ka ra</span></p><p begin="03:22.714" end="03:24.112" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2235">もう一度ゆこう<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">再一次走上人生旅途</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mo u i chi do yu ko u</span></p><p begin="03:24.122" end="03:25.877" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2236">叶えるために<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我是为了实现梦想</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ka na e ru ta me ni</span></p><p begin="03:25.887" end="03:27.536" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2237">生きてるんだって<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">才活在这一生</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i ki te ru n da 't te</span></p><p begin="03:27.546" end="03:29.328" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2238">叫びたくなるよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">好想大声喊出来</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">sa ke bi ta ku na ru yo</span></p><p begin="03:29.338" end="03:31.023" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2239">聞こえていますか？<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你们是否听见？</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki ko e te i ma su ka ?</span></p><p begin="03:31.033" end="03:32.735" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2240">無難になんて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">什么低调隐忍</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">bu na n ni na n te</span></p><p begin="03:32.745" end="03:36.197" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2241">やってられないから<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我已经忍无可忍</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ya 't te ra re na i ka ra</span></p><p begin="03:36.207" end="03:37.861" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2242">…帰る場所もないの<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">反正我也没有回头路</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ka e ru ba sho mo na i no</span></p><p begin="03:37.871" end="03:41.248" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2243">優しさには いつも感謝してる<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">对大家的善意 我时刻满怀感激</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ya sa shi sa ni wa i tsu mo ka n sha shi te ru</span></p><p begin="03:41.258" end="03:43.279" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2244">だから強くなりたい<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">所以我才向往着更强</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">da ka ra tsu yo ku na ri ta i</span></p><p begin="03:44.740" end="03:46.682" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2245">懐かしくなる<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">反正也算一种怀旧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">na tsu ka shi ku na ru</span></p><p begin="03:46.692" end="03:48.410" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2246">こんな痛みも歓迎じゃん<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这些痛楚 我就算欢迎又何妨</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko n na i ta mi mo ka n ge i ja n</span></p></div></body></tt>